<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Korenta</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ko</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korenta</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Korenta</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Korenta</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Teerndiŋ Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci teeɓohiɗ kaɗaŋ Pool koc ŋ kur kaŋ Korenta ŋ saar 18:1-18. A tumiɗ ndaam ini uup kiis na camban, wala kiis kanak sah. Wa nikee ŋ reehɗohaaniŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ɗe yakki kanakɗoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:40-18:22">Tum ci 15:40–18:22</ref></char></note> Pool kaɗisseen Korenta kotiŋ ɗe kanakɗoh, waaye wa naandsukuuɗi ŋ teerndiŋ Tum ci<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:1">2 Korenta 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:14">12:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 13:1">13:1</ref></char></note>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaɓɗohi kanakɗoh a fiis ɓi Korenta wii, a fiisoha kur kaŋ Maseduwaan ; a woyissa in ci a tufuk tum ŋ kaɗiŋ ɗe kaahayɗoh ŋ Korenta.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:1-10">2 Korenta 13:1-10</ref></char></note> Ŋ mirndaani a kaɗangiɗ kaɗi a woyee weem te wa teeɓohuuɗ ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:2">Tum ci 20:2</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Fu jang kaɓɗohii ɗah, fu hey hote ne raakiɗ ini raak ŋ harmban ce na ɓak ngaŋ ɓi Janguuniŋ Korenta. A na teeɓohe ne a yi ŋ keeh ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe na mandohaaɗiŋ ɗe, a ndengɗee ca. A na teeɓohe ne a waaɗiɗ ne ɓa eɗ ɗe cir <char style="tl">apootar</char>, te ɓa waaɗ ɗe findi a waaɗoh ɓa. A teeɓohiɗ nik <char style="tl">apootar</char> ini wa tokis, na ɓi na woye ne ɓa <char style="tl">apootar</char> te ɓa nikɗaa. A rahassa yegɗoh neɓiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi Korenta, a summba nga lool. A nammba eɗoh nakoh ne kosiɗ ci raakaaɗiici nik ŋ Yerusalem nangɗohɗu kopor.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Korenta kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh na corkiɗ Kooh ngaŋ giifiɗ ci a giifɗoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool teeɓohiɗ ne tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe lakiɗ waas <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-6:10">1:12–6:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh wuu ɓi Korenta <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 6:11-7:2">6:11–7:2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Yegɗoh neɓiɗ ŋ Korenta - sumiŋ Pool <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 7:3-16">7:3-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Dengoh na nakoh nangɗoh kopor wuu ɓi Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1–9:15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool mineen degoh miskiɗ, waaye a waaɗ teeɓoh baah <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:13">10:1–13:13</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>Mi yii kañɗis ɗu, ɗu ɓi Janguuniŋ Kooh nik ŋ Korenta na ɓooɓiŋ Kooh ŋ Akaay jen. Mi yi Pool, <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh, ñam na fiisee ɗu kaytii, mi na ɓaah ɓoo Timoote. <verse eid="2CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam ; Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam !<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Giifɗiŋ miskiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Kooh, yi nik Koohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, a nammba nik Baabiŋ ɗe, a yakɗaah, a yi Baabi, yi ɓooɓi jen na miske, Kooh yi na giifɗohe ŋ in nu nik. <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>A yi na giifɗe ɓoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Waas laayiɗ, Pool woyee ndii ɗah, a na woye "ɓoo". Fu kerah "ɓoo" ɗah, wa miniɗ nik ne a na woye haf ce dong, wala a yi na ɓi ɓo' wiiriis. Ŋ kaɓɗoh ciŋ jamanoonaam, wa mandee ɗaa.</char></note> ngaŋ miskiɗ ciŋ ɓoo jen ne ɓoo min giifiɗ ɓi nik ngaŋ miskiɗ nu nik ! Ŋ ineem ɓoo giifiɗ ɓa na giifɗi a giifɗoh ɓoo. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Findi miskiɗ ci ɓoo ɓaah na Kiristaani laayoh, giifɗi Kooh na giifɗe ɓoo taamboh ŋ Kiristaani laayoh ɗaa.<verse eid="2CO 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Ɓoo nik ŋ miskiɗ ɗah, ɓoo nik nga ne ɗu giifɗu, ɗu nam muc ; ɓoo giifɗu ɗah, wa giifɗohaa ɗu ne ɗu ndengɗuk, ɗu min muñ miskiɗ ciŋ ɗu mand na ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Te yaakaari ɓoo raak nga ɗu ndengiɗ, ɓoo inhiɗ ne findi ɗu na ɓaahohe ŋ miskiɗ ci, ɗu na ɓaahohe ɗaa ŋ giifɗi.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>Kon ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo waaɗiɗ ne ɗu inah miskiɗ ci rahas ɓoo ŋ kur caŋ Asi : Ɓoo degseen miskiɗ keeh-keeh po ɓoo antalisseeɗi ca, ɓoo liiɓeeɗi sah ne ɓoo hey rise pes. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Ɓoo ambee ne sah ɓoo joy joy kaan ; ineem raakiɗ ne ɓoo oolkohuu haf ɓoo, ɓoo oolkoh Kooh yi na hultiɗe kaaniɗ ci. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>A yi muciɗ ɓoo ŋ kakaan ki miskiɗeem, te a hey ɓoo mucɗisse. Ɓoo oolkiɗ ne a genan ɓoo muciɗ. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>Kiimi ɗu kiimɗee ɓoo Kooh nam ɓaah nga ; ŋ ineem, ɓo' laayiɗ kiimɗiɗ ɓoo, tahha po ɓo' laayiɗ hey corkiɗe Kooh ŋ baahohi a baahoh ɓoo.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool oorɗiɗ ɓaaɓiŋ ɗe Korenta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>Inii weɗ ɓoo na ndamkohe te liiɓ ciŋ ɓoo seede'iɗa, weɗ ne : Keeh na hool puloh ŋ Kooh, ceɗ ɓoo na pesohe na ɓi Adina, ɓoo na uupe ca pesoh na ɗu. Nikɗi haa ne wa ñaañi puloh ŋ ɓo' on ɓoo ineem, waaye wa baahohiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13-14"/>Ɓoo na fiiseeɗi ɗu in wiiriis ɗal ini ɗu min jang te ɗu inaha. Raakiɗ ini ɗu camb inah, te ŋ liiɓiɗ ne ɗu heya inhe jen, weɗ ne ŋ mbehi Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu dokkohan, ɗu hey neɓse nga ɓoo, te ɓoo neɓu nga ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 1:13-14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Ineem wooreen ndo, weɗ tah po ŋ ammba ne ŋ kockohan nga ɗu ne ɗu sum ŋ kot ci kanak ci ŋ raakan ndeem. <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/>Weɗ ne ŋ waaɗeen taamboh nga ɗu ne ŋ hayee Maseduwaan ndii ɗah ; te ŋ namee wiiruk ɗah, ŋ taambis nga ɗu ne ɗu ɓaatɗoh ho ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ngo ŋ waas Yudee.<verse eid="2CO 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Ɗu liiɓ ne wi ŋ woyee ŋ ɗooƴ co ne ineem weɗ maa hee tume, ŋ liiɓɗi liiɓɗi nga e ? Wala ɗu liiɓ ne ŋ raak liiɓohaaɗ ɓo' dong, po "ee"-iŋ ngo miniɗ nik "a'aa" ne ŋ tufuk ne ŋ tum in ɗah ? <verse eid="2CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Wa wooriɗ Kooh ne, woo ki ɓoo na woyee ɗu wa "ee" na "a'aa" haa. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/>Laam <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char>, Yeesu Kiristaa yi ɓoo woyee ɗu, mi na Silweng na Timoote, a "ee" na "a'aa" haa ; a moos nik "ee" dong. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Te in ci Kooh gapoh, ini ca laay jen, ca "ee" ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa. Ineem weɗ nam tah po wa taamboh nga ɗe, ɓoo woyee "amiin" weɗ "ee", ne ɓoo yakiɗ Kooh. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>A Kooh ambsoh ɓoo na ɗu, a ndengiɗta ɓoo ŋ Kiristaani, a degiɗ ɓoo ne ɓoo pangkiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>A ñaassa ɓoo, a tummba <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ ɗe</char> ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo, ineem nikka firnde ne in ci a gap ɓoo jen, ɓoo hey ca rahse.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Kon Kooh miniɗ to seede, ŋ lee ɗah, ŋ kaanaat : Ŋ sang ɗu ɓek miskiɗ weɗ tah ŋ hayisɗi Korenta poyi. <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>Nikɗi haa ne ɓoo waaɗ ɗu deg yaah ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosiŋ ɗu laam ɗu ndengiɗ nga. Ɓoo kay, ɓoo na ɓaatɗohee ɗu ŋ sumiŋ ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Ineem weɗ tah ŋ ambiɗ ŋ haf fo ne ŋ heyɗi dokke ŋ ɗiskiŋ ɗu feeh in ci neɓaaɗiici reehɗi ɗah. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Ŋ ɓek ɗu neɓaaɗi ɗah, a ya ɓa sumɗan ndo ? Ɗu ɓi ŋ ɓek neɓaaɗi e ? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Ineem weɗ tah ŋ fiissa ɗu kaɓɗohi mirndoh, ŋ sangee hay nga ɗu po ɗu kee so ɓeka neɓaaɗi, ɗu ɓi joyee so sumiɗ. Ɗu jen, wa wooriɗ to ne, ŋ sum ɗah ɗu sum. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Wi maa fiisee ɗu wa, ŋ fiisa ŋ tiis miskiɗ na keeñ reehiɗ, na muhun laayiɗ ; ŋ fiisɗaa ne ŋ ɓek ɗu neɓaaɗi, waaye ne ɗu inah waaɗi ŋ waaɗ ɗu, findi wa yakoh.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ɗaasiɗ ɓoyi ɓekoh neɓaaɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Ɓoyi ɓekoh neɓaaɗi, a ɓek ko wa haa ; ŋ sang uupiɗ, waaye ŋ miniɗ woo ne, a ɓek ɗu wa jen. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Ini ɓi uup nga ɗu deg ɓoyeem, doyiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Tahha po ini ngisoh kotii, weɗ ne ɗu ɗaas ɗe te ɗu daliɗ heliŋ ɗe, ne a raakuu neɓaaɗiini a antalanɗi. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Mi yii kiim ɗu, teeɓaat ɗe ne ɗu waaɗiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="2CO 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Ŋ waaɗee ɗu nam markisuk, weɗ tah ŋ fiissa ɗu, ne ŋ inah andi ɗu hey yo kerhiɗe ŋ in nu nik. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>Ɗu ɗaas ɓo' ɗah, ŋ ɗaas ɗe ; nik ne raakiɗ ini ŋ joyee ɗaasoh ɗah, ŋ ɗaasohiɗa saguuɗu ŋ fiki <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Ŋ tum ineem ne ŋ onuu Seytaani waas nga ɓoo, laam ɓoo inhiɗ baahiɗ ini a waaɗ tum.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ŋ Torowaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Wa ŋ kaɗ Torowaas ne ŋ woo <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wi kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani, ŋ hotiɗ ne Heɗi rangsiɗiɗ to bunta nga ne ŋ panguk. <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/>Waaye heliŋ ngo daleeɗi, ŋ raakɗi ɓaah ɓoo Tit nga, weɗ tah ŋ askohha na ɓa, ŋ hayya Maseduwaan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndami Kiristaani on ɓoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Waaye, ɓoo corkiɗaat Kooh. A na gene ɓoo maaƴɗukoh ŋ mbehiŋ yakɗiŋ ndamiŋ ɗe ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani, te a taambohee nga ɓoo ne Kiristaani inhu ŋ ɗisik nu nik findi eeñ laackoloñ. <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>Ngaŋ Kooh, e ɓoo eeñɗiŋ Kiristaani, wa neɓiɗ findi laackoloñ. Ɓoo ɓii eeñ ɓi nik ŋ waasiŋ muci, na ɓi nik ŋ waasiŋ muuƴi. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Ŋ ɓum, ɓoo na ote kakaan, oti na ɓayee kaan ; ŋ ɓinooɓi, ɓoo na eeñe kipes, eeñi na ɓaye pes. A yi nde ɓo' min ineem ? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Ɓoo nak, ɓoo mandɗi na ɓi laayiɗ, ɓi tum woo kiŋ Kooh toontuk. Ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani, ɓoo na yegɗohe Woo ki na keeñ hooliɗ ŋ fiki Kooh, yi woos ɓoo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Surgaaciŋ Ambtiɗohi Asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Kinaat liiɓ ne ini ŋ woo weem tokis ne ɓoo na cambise woo ne a ɓoo min pangki. Ɓoo etohɗi ne ɓi ɓo' fiisiɗ ɗu kayit ne ɓa woo ɗu ineem findi ɓinooɓi na tumohee wa, te ɓoo namɗi etoh ne ɗu tumiɗ ɓoo ineem. <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>E ɗu kayteem, kayti fiisu ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo, wi ɓooɓi jen min jang, ɓa inaha. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/>Wa hooliɗ ne e ɗu kayti <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> fiis, a taambɗohhaa ŋ pangkiŋ ɓoo. Kayteem fiisohuuɗi fiisoha, wa fiisohu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Koohi</char> na pese. Wa fiisuuɗi ŋ atoh ɗapas,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Pula 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 31:18">31:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:19">32:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:1">34:1</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 34:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 40:20">40:20</ref> </char></note> wa fiisu ŋ keeñ ci. <verse eid="2CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Ineem weɗ oolki ɓoo ooluk Kooh taamboh ŋ Kiristaani.<verse eid="2CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Wa nikɗi haa ne ɓoo amb ne ɓoo miniɗ haɓiɗ in ngaŋ min-miniŋ ɓoo. Te ɓoo liiɓɗi ne ineem puloh nga ɓoo, min-miniŋ ɓoo puloh ŋ Kooh. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/>A yi nam on ɓoo po ɓoo minnda nik ɓi na pangkiɗe ambtiɗoh as, wi gaƴukɗi ŋ waasi fiisu waaye ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>. Waasi fiisu na apohe apoh, waaye Fuuɗsi na onohe kipes.<verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Nakoh ciŋ waasi fiissee ŋ atoh ɗapas dong te siñaariŋ yaki Kooh yak nikee wiliɗ ca po Israayel ci mineeɗi marak ŋ fikiiriŋ <char style="w">Musaa</char> sagu siñaara, te siñaaraam geneeɗi. Nik ne e pangkiŋ waasi fiisu, wi na ɓayohe ŋ kakaan weɗ hunee na kiyak hend ɗaa ɗah, <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>kon pangkiŋ Fuuɗsi, kiyak kiŋ wa hendan na ? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Nik ne pangkiŋ waasi na atte'e ɓo' tooñ weɗ raak kiyak ɗah, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa wi na tahe Kooh amb ɓo' ɓo' yurhiɗ ! <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Ɓoo miniɗ woo ne siñaarɗiŋ kiyak ki wotɓa wa tus haa ŋ siñaarɗiŋ wi woti. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Nik ne wi genɗi weɗ siñaarɗee ɗah, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa wi genan gen.<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Oolki ɓoo ooluk ne kiyak keem genan gen na tahe ɓoo kaañ keeh-keeh. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/>Te ɓoo tumɗi findi Musaa, yi muuree fikiiriŋ ɗe ne Israayel ci markuu reehiŋ siñaari genaaɗiini. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Waaye ɓa sangee sang inah. Po woti sah, ɓa jangeesa Fiis ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗoha Maañɗa</char> ɗah, muureem na rise nga. Wa nihsukɗi, wa na coote rek ne fu nikka ŋ Kiristaani ɗah. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Po woti sah, Israayel ci jangeesa teereeciŋ Musaa ɗah, liiɓohaaciŋ ɓa na nike muurkiɗ.<verse eid="2CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/>Waaye ɓo' nu hay ŋ Heɗi ɗah, muuri nihsu. <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Fu hay ŋ Heɗi ɗah, weɗ ne fu hay ŋ Fuuɗsi ; te ɗisik nu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Heɗi</char> nik ɗah, raak haf fu raakiɗ nga. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Ɓoo jen, ɓoo ɓi na fikiici raakisɗi muur, siñaariŋ Heɗi wa ɗii saañis nga ɓoo findi seetu ; Heɗi, maanaam Fuuɗsi, a yii ɓoƴsoh ɓoo po, ɓoo mandan na ɗe, wa ɓaatke, siñaariŋ ɓoo uupee nga laay.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Raak-raaki tumu ŋ tumoha mahuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>In ceem tah po, ɓoo misikka Kooh, a dengkohha ɓoo pangkii, weɗ tah po ɓoo faɗsukanɗi. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Ɓoo kay, ɓoo sangiɗ in ci ɗasɗukiɗ ci na kaci'ɗohe ; ɓoo ñaañohɗi ɓo' te ɓoo ɓoƴsohɗi woo kiŋ Kooh. Ɓoo na teeɓohe keeh ki, ne yaa nu nga min teyɗuk ŋ fiki Kooh ne ɓoo ɓo' yurhiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>Nik ne yegɗohiŋ muci ɓoo na yegɗohe muuruk muuruk ɗah, wa muuruk ŋ ɓi nik ŋ waas sooƴ. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Seytaani, yi min ŋ adinaanii, a yi fuuliɗ ñaañiŋ kosaaɗiici po ɓa minɗi hot siñaariŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, weɗ ne siñaariŋ yaki <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> yak, yi ñaamaariŋ Kooh.<verse eid="2CO 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Ɓoo yegɗohɗi haf ɓoo, ɓoo na yegɗohe ne Yeesu Kiristaa a yi Heɗi, te ɓoo sah, ɓoo <char style="w">ñaam</char> ciŋ ɗu saguuce. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/>Laam Kooh yi woo ne : « Ŋ ɗooƴ ñuusi, ñiin siñaarɗaat nga, » a yi siñaariɗ ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo, ne ɓoo inah yaki a yak wi na siñaarɗe ŋ fikiiriŋ Kiristaani. <verse eid="2CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Ɓoo nak, raak-raakeem tumu nga ɓoo, waaye ɓoo tumoha mahuuɗ, ne wa teeɓoh ne hatili yakohngaaneem, wa wiŋ ɓoo haa, wa wiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>Ɓoo na degse miskiɗ nu nik, waaye ɓoo na pule nga, ɓoo jaahɗiɗ waaye ɓoo ñakɗi yaakaar. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Ɓoo ɓii tolfiɗu waaye Kooh faɗɗi ɓoo, ɓoo ɓii folu waaye ɓoo ɗumbuuɗi.<verse eid="2CO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Kakaan kiŋ Yeesu weɗi ŋ faan ciŋ ɓoo ŋ ɗisik nu ɗisik, ne kipes kiŋ ɗe nam hotuk ŋ faan ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Laam ɓoo ɓii pes waaye ɓoo gen yurhiɗkoh na kakaan sagu Yeesu, ne kipes kiŋ ɗe nam hotuk ŋ faan ciŋ ɓoo, ci kaanan. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Ŋ ineem a kakaan na pangke nga ɓoo, waaye a kipes na pangke nga ɗu. <verse eid="2CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>Ɓo' woyiɗ ŋ Fiis ci hooliɗ ci ne : « Ŋ kos kos weɗ tah ŋ woyiɗ ! »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Sabuur 116:10</ref> </char></note> Ɓoo nam raak <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi</char> ɓoyeem raak, Fuuɗsi na onohe kos, tahha po ɓoo namiɗ kos, weɗ tah ɓoo namee woo. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Ɓoo inhiɗ ne Yi hultiɗ Heɗi Yeesu, hey ɓoo name hultiɗ ne ɓoo nik na ɗe, a tufkiɗ ɓoo na ɗu jen ŋ fikiice.<verse eid="2CO 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>In ceem jen, ca ɗii rahas ɓoo saguuɗu, ne baahohiŋ Kooh pasarkoh te wa ree ŋ ɓo' laayiɗ ; ɓi corkiɗan ɗe uupee nga laay, ɓa hun, ɓa yakɗee ɗe.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Ineem weɗ tah ɓoo na faɗsukeeɗi. Ali nik ne faan ciŋ ɓoo ca ɗii yahkeeɗa, keeñ ciŋ ɓoo na uupe as Kooh-nu-wiis. <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Laam miskiɗ ciŋ ɓoo woti ɓoo hendtiɗkoh ca na yaki genan gen ɓoo yakan ɗah, ca in eɗfiɗ te ca maañɗi, ca na kooɗkiɗe ɓoo yakeem. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Te ɓoo na markeeɗi ŋ in ci na hotse, waaye ŋ ci minɗi hotu. Laam ci na hotse ca na maañeeɗi, waaye ci minɗi hotu genan gen.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Genohaaci kanak ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>Ɓoo inhiɗ ne ɗiip ci ɓoo genoh ŋ kehƴi cii, maanaam faan ciŋ ɓoo ndii, kaɗ po ca yahuk ɗah, ɓoo raakiɗ taɓah ŋ Eel ci, maanaam faan as. E Kooh haɓiɗ ca, ca genohaaci genan gen, ci yaah ɓo' haɓiɗɗi. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Ɓoo ɓii iineeɗa ŋ ɗiip ci, ɓoo waaɗta lool degsoh ɓekkaah ciŋ ɓoo as ci, maanaam taɓah ciŋ ɓoo puloh ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Ee, wa wooriɗ to ne ɓoo hey ca ɓekɗasse, ɓoo telsanɗi raakaaɗi faan. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Ee, jamanooni ɓoo nik ŋ ɗiip cii jen iinee sagu ɓituk, nikɗi haa ne ɓoo waaɗ woluk faan ciŋ ɓoo, waaye ɓoo waaɗ degsohɗu na faan as ne kipes ki keeh-keehi on do'ɗok wi kaanan. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Ineem, weɗ ini Kooh ŋ haf ce kooɗkiɗ ɓoo. A yi eɗ ɓoo <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, ineem nikka firnde ne in ci a gap ɓoo jen, ɓoo hey ca rahse.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Kon ɓoo gen kaañiɗ. Waaye ɓoo inhiɗ ne feeh ɓoo ɓii gennda ŋ faan cii ɗah, ɓoo genan usiɗ Heɗi. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>Laam ɓoo na kaɗohe kos waaye ini ɓoo na hote haa. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>Mbaa ɗah, ɓoo kaañiɗ, te ini ngisohiɗ ɓoo weɗ ne ɓoo faɗ faan cii, ɓoo haad ŋ Heɗi.<verse eid="2CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>Ineem weɗ tah ɓoo ndengɗukee ne a neɓu nga ɓoo ŋ ɗisik nu ɓoo nik ɗah, ali ɓoo ris ŋ faan cii wala ɓoo faɗ ca, haad nga ɗe sah. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Laam ɓoo jen joyiɗ tufuk ŋ fiki <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> ne a attee ɓoo, yaa nu nga wirndu in ci a tumee na faaniŋ ɗe, baahiɗ na baahaaɗi jen.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kerhiɗoh na Kooh taamboh ŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Inhi ɓoo inah ini nik ŋ nup Heɗi, tahiɗ po ɓoo na waaɗe teeɓ ɓooɓi po ɓa inah keeh ki ; Kooh inhiɗ ɓoo baahiɗ, te ŋ namiɗ liiɓ ne ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ciŋ ɗu, ɗu namiɗ ɓoo inah. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Ɓoo hayɗi ne ɓoo na woyee ɗu ne e ɓoo min pangki ; ɓoo na onee ɗu, ɗu min ndamkoh ɓoo. Ŋ ineem ɗu hey mine lof ɓi na ndamkohe ini na hotse te ɓa na ndamkoheeɗi ini nik ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Ɓoo ambu naandiɗ ɗah, wa wuu Kooh ; ɓoo ambu ñaañiɗ ɗah, wa wuu ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Waaɗi Kiristaani waaɗ ɓoo, ɓoo minɗi ɓoof naa, ɓoo hotiɗ ne : Ɓo' yino kaan wuu ɓooɓi jen ɗah, kon ɓooɓi jen kaaniɗ ; <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>te a kaan wuu ɓooɓi jen, ne pesoh ci pesissuu wuu haf ɓa, waaye wuu Yi kaan, hulitta wuu ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Weɗ tah ɗiski wa nik, ɓoo markohisɗi ali ɓo' findi ɓooɓi na markohe ; ali nik ne sah wotɓa ɓoo markohee Kiristaani findi ɓooɓi markohee ɗe, woti ɓoo markohisɗi ɗe ɗaa.<verse eid="2CO 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Ɓo' nikka ŋ Kiristaani ɗah, a na nike feruuɗ as. In ca maañiɗ ca cootiɗ, in ci jen as kotii. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Te ineem jen puloh ŋ Kooh, yi taamboh ŋ Kiristaani, kerhiɗohiɗta ɓoo na haf ce, te a eɗta ɓoo pangki ne ɓoo teeɓee ɓooɓi findi ɓa kerhiɗohan na ɗe. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Weɗ ne Kooh nikee ŋ Kiristaani kerhiɗohɗeeɗa ɓi Adina na haf ce, te a marakɗi ɗal ciŋ ɓooɓi. A eɗ ɓoo woo kiŋ kerhiɗohi ne ɓoo yegɗoha.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Ɓoo nikiɗ Kiristaani ; wa mand haa a Kooh na ñaahee ɗu taamboh nga ɓoo : Ɓoo kiim ɗu wa kiim ŋ tiikiŋ Kiristaani : Teyɗukaat kerhiɗohɗu na Kooh ! <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Yi moosɗi bakaaɗoh, deguuɗ bakaaɗiŋ ɓoo. Ineem raakiɗ ne, ŋ niki ɓoo nik nga ɗe, ɓoo onu kiyurah ŋ fiki Kooh.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Ini ɓoo na pangke na Kooh tahiɗ po ɓoo na ñaahee ɗu ne rahsi ɗu rahas baahohiŋ Kooh nikuu ɓarang ɓarang. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/>Laam a woyiɗ ŋ Fiis ci ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">« Ŋ jamanooniŋ wa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ŋ teyiɗ kiimiŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ŋ mbehiŋ muci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">ŋ hirpiɗ ɗa. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Esayi 49:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Jamanooni weɗɗi ! Mbehiŋ muci weɗɗi de' !<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pangkoh ciŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>Ɓoo waaɗɗi ne ɓo' raak woyaah moɗaaɗi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ pangkiŋ ɓoo, ineem weɗ tah ɓoo waaɗɗi kafind ali ɓo' ŋ in nu wa min nik ɗah. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Waaye ŋ in nu nik, ɓoo na teeɓohe ne ɓoo mokɗiɗ pangkiŋ surgaaciŋ Kooh :</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:4"/>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:4">Ɓoo ɓii muñ ngaŋ miskiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:4">na tolfiɗ ci keeh-keeh,<verse eid="2CO 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/>na laɓ ci ɓoo na laɓse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:5">na taƴ ciŋ kasooci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:5">na ɗuuɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:5">na panguk ci miskiɗ ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:5">na aɗki, na neehaaɗiiki.<verse eid="2CO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>Ɓoo na teeɓohee ɓooɓi ɓoo nikoh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:6">na hool kiŋ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:6">na inhiŋ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:6">na mini ɓoo min muñ seke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:6">na baah kiŋ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:6">na niki <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> nik nga ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:6">na waaɗohi kiyooh ki.<verse eid="2CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>Ɓoo ɓii teeɓoha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:7">na woo kiŋ keeh ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:7">na hatiliŋ Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:7">na kiyurah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:7">wi ɓoo tum ganaay,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:7">ganaay songoha na naafkoha.<verse eid="2CO 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Ɓoo yakɗu, ɓoo ƴissuutɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:8">ɓoo ɓii teeɓoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:8">Ɓoo woyu in moɗaaɗi, ɓoo woyu moɗiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:8">ɓoo ɓii teeɓoha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CO 6:8"/>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:8">Ɓoo ɓii teeɓoha ŋ in nu nik :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:8">Ɓoo ambu findi leyoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:8">te ɓoo na woye keeh.<verse eid="2CO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Ɓoo ambu findi inhassaaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:9">te ɓoo inhuuɗ baahiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:9">Ɓoo ambu findi ɓi na kaane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:9">te ɓoo ɓii pes.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:9">Ɓoo ɓii torhiɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:9">te ɓoo apuuɗi.<verse eid="2CO 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Ɓoo ambu findi ɓi neɓuuɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:10">te ɓoo gen sumiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:10">Ɓoo ambu findi ñakiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:10">te ɓoo ɓii tah ɓo' laayiɗ raak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:10">Ɓoo ambu findi raakaaɗi ali in,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:10">te in ci jen cuu ɓoo.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>Ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo gen Korenta, ɓoo woyiɗ na ɗu halang, ɓoo ɓekiɗ ɗu ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Ɗu ɓengɗi nga, e keeñ ciŋ ɗu ɓeng. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Mi na woye na ɗu findi ɓoyi na woye na kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, tumaat findi ɓoo, rangsukaat baahiɗ !<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saɓsukohaat na hoolaaɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Findi ɗoopaat ɓaahaaɗi minohɗi ɓaah tokiɗ sareet, kinaat nam ɓaah raanaah na kosaaɗiici. Ini yurah na ini yurahɗi ɓaah ye ? Wala siñaar na ñuus min ye ɓaah ? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/><char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> na Seytaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seytaani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ Fiis ci ndii, gerek woo "Beliyar", wa ɓaah ŋ tiik ciŋ Seytaani.</char></note> min kerhiɗoh ŋ ye ? Wala kosiɗ na kosaaɗi min hunoh na ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/>Kahan Kooh min ye kerhiɗoh na kooh ci nikaaɗiici ? Laam e ɓoo kahniŋ Koohi na pese findi a woyoha an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">« Ŋ hey gene na ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">ŋ tiindee ŋ harmban ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">ŋ nik Koohiŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">ɓa nik cuuɓiŋ ngo. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lewiici 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Esekiyeel 37:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/>Weɗ tah a woosa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">« Pulaat ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">Saɓsukohaat na ɓa !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">Kinaat laal in hoolaaɗi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Esayi 52:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">te mi ŋ hey ɗu taambɗuke.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:41">Esekiyeel 20:41</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>Ŋ hey nike Baab nga ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">ɗu nik kuɓuuciŋ ngo !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Samuwel 7:14</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:18">Heɗi, yi Heɗ-hatil woo ineem.<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Mbaa ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, nik ne ɓoo gapuuɗ in ceem jen ɗah, kon ɓoo farsukaat usuɓ ci jen, ci nik ŋ faan ci na liiɓ ci, te ɓoo mitiɗ hool kiŋ ɓoo ŋ nupi ɓoo nup Kooh.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sum kiŋ Pool ŋ hayiŋ Tit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>Ɓekaat ɓoo ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu ! Ɓoo tumɗi ali ɓo' in baahaaɗi, ɓoo yahrohɗi ali ɓo', te ɓoo njirñiɗkohɗi ali ɓo'. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Ŋ wooɗi ineem ne ŋ attee ɗu tooñ, laam ŋ woyiɗ po ƴutiɗ ne : Ali ɓoo pesee wala ɓoo kaan, ɗu ɓii ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Ɗu oniɗ to ne ŋ woo ɗu ini nik nga so keeh-keeh, te ŋ neɓuuɗ nga ɗu lool. Na miskiɗ ci ɓoo na pese jen, keeñiŋ ngo soosɗuuɗ, ŋ riifiɗ na sum.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Laam ina ɓoo reyoh Maseduwaan poyi, ɓoo raakɗi jot iɗsiɗkoha ; ɓoo cohiɗ na miskiɗ nu nik, leber ŋ hari na neƴƴoh ŋ ɗooƴ fu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Waaye Kooh yi na dalɗe hel ciŋ ɓi goy, dalɗiɗ hel ciŋ ɓoo ŋ hayiŋ ɓaah ɓoo Tit. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Te wa hayiŋ ɗe dong haa, waaye na dalɗi ɗu daliɗ heliŋ ɗe : A naandsukiɗ ɓoo waaɗi ɗu waaɗ to hotis, na fuɗ ciŋ ɗu, na sawri ɗu sawar ŋ amboh ho. Ineem weɗ tah ho ɓaat sum.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu raakeen ini misik ɗu ŋ fiisi ŋ kaɓɗohee ɗu, waaye inwaaso ambɗi so nga. Wa keeh ne inwaaso ambeen ndo nga wa ŋ hot ne ɗu raakiɗ neɓaaɗi wa ɗu rahasa, ali nik ne wa maañɗi. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Waaye ɗiski wa nik ndii ŋ sumiɗ, ŋ sumɗi ŋ neɓaaɗiini ɗu raakee nga, ŋ sum ŋ ini neɓaaɗiineem ɓek ɗu ŋ ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ ; laam neɓaaɗiineem in baahiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh, kon ɓoo degɗi ɗu ali in baahaaɗi.<verse eid="2CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Neɓaaɗiini fu raak ŋ waaɗi fu waaɗ Kooh na ɓekee ɗa ŋ ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ, wi na ɓayee ɗa ŋ muc te inwaaso ambuu ɓo' nga. Waaye neɓaaɗiini fu raak ŋ waaɗi fu waaɗ Adina na ɓekee ɗa ŋ kaan. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>Te neɓaaɗiini fu raak sagu waaɗ Kooh weem, wa in baahiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh. Markaat ini wa ɓek nga ɗu : Findi ɗu njahlafoh kotii na findi ɗu na taaskohɗe haf ɗu, findi ɗu raakoh neɓsaaɗi ; markaat findi ɗu nupoh tum in moɗaaɗi, findi ɗu waaɗoh ho hot, findi ɗu sawaroh ŋ in ciŋ Kooh, na findi ɗu na kuƴsohe ini baahɗi ! Ɗu teeɓohiɗ ŋ in ci jen ne ɗu hooliɗ ngaŋ ineem.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Wi ŋ fiisee ɗu kayteem, a ɓoyi tooñ tah ho fiisa haa, te a ɓoyi tooñu tah haa, waaye ŋ fiisiɗa ne sawri ɗu sawar nga ɓoo, ɗu mina hot ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Ineem weɗ tah po hel ciŋ ɓoo daliɗ, te wa ineem dong haa sah, keeñ ciŋ ɓoo namiɗ soos keeh-keeh ŋ sumi Tit sum ŋ findi ɗu jen dalɗoh heliŋ ɗe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>Nik ne ŋ ndamkohiɗ ɗu ŋ fikiice ɗah, ŋ raakɗi kaci nga ; laam wa hooliɗ kotii ne ndamkohi ɓoo ndamkohee ɗu ŋ fiki Tit nikee keeh, findi in ci ɓoo woyee na ɗu jen nikoh keeh. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>A naandsukka kerhiɗi ɗu kerhiɗ ɗe ɗah, waaɗi a waaɗ ɗu na ɓaatke ɓaatuk, laam ɗu taambɗukiɗ ɗe na eɗef na cir. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Ŋ sumiɗ ŋ oolki ŋ min ɗu ooluk ŋ in ci jen.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Onoh ci wuu kosiɗ ciŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>Ɓaah ci, ɓoo waaɗ ɗu woo baahohi Kooh baahoh Janguucaŋ Maseduwaan. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Na ini ɓa nikee ŋ miskiɗ jen, ɓa sumiɗ keeh-keeh. Te na ñaki miskiɗi ɓa ñakee jen, ɓa teeɓohiɗ waaɗ onoh keeh-keeh. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Ŋ miniɗa seede, ɓa eɗohiɗ ini ɓa minee eɗoh, ini uupa sah te ɓa tuma na keeñ moɗiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/>Ɓa kiim kiim ɓoo keeh-keeh ne ɓa min ɓaah ŋ ɓi na hee kaɓɗohe ɓaatɗoh wuu kosiɗ ci nik ŋ Yerusalem. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Ŋ waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh, ɓa eɗoh haf ɓa ŋ Heɗi paaɗ, ɓa nammba eɗoh haf ɓa nga ɓoo. Ineem uupiɗ ini ɓoo sekee nga ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Ineem weɗ tah, ɓoo ñaahha Tit ne a ɗiindoh nangɗohiŋ in ci ɗu onoh ŋ ndeem findi a cambohee wa, pangkiŋ ɗu moɗiɗ lool.<verse eid="2CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>Findi ɗu riifoh ŋ in ci jen, ŋ kos, na min woo, na inah in ciŋ Kooh, na tokɗuk ŋ in nu nik, na waaɗohi ɓoo yun nga ɗu, ndengɗukohaat ɗaa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ onohi.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Nikɗi haa ne ɗu joya joy tum, waaye mi na woyee ɗu rek findi ɓinooɓi tokɗukoh, ne ŋ hotoot ne waaɗi ɗu waaɗ ɓooɓi, wa waaɗoh keeh-keeh. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>Ɗu inhiɗ findi Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> baahohoh ɓoo, a yi raakee, a nikka ñakiɗ wuu ɗu, ne ɗu min raak, sagu ñaki a ñak.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Wa waas ne ŋ woo ini ŋ liiɓ nga, laam yukma, e ɗu koc nangɗoh kopor ɓaatɗohoha ɓinooɓi, te a ɗu aduka waaɗ tum. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Kon ɗiski wa nik, ɗiindohaat ineem. Ɗiindohaata na ini ɗu min tum, findi ɗu waaɗohee wa tum.<verse eid="2CO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Laam waaɗ tum nik nga ɗah, Kooh teyɗuk, a na marke ŋ ini fu raak, a marakɗi ŋ ini fu raakɗi. <verse eid="2CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Nikɗi haa ne e ɗu joy deguk miskiɗ ne ɗu eɗfiɗ ɓinooɓi, waaye ɓooɓi jen joy joy hend. <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>Woti, ɗu raakiɗ po ɗu gaacaacɗiɗ kon ɗu miniɗ ɓa ɓaatɗoh ŋ ñakiŋ ɓa ; kim, ɗu nam ñak te wa raak ɓa gaacaacɗiɗ ɗah, ɓa ɓaatɗoh ɗu, jaar ɗu jen ɗu hendiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/>Wa hun na ini Fiis ci woo an : « Ɓa ɓayee juuk uupɗeeɗi te ɓa ɓayee ƴissuut mitɗeen. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Pula 16:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi Tit tuuƴuuɗ ne ɓa taambkoha onoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Ɓoo ɓii corkiɗ Kooh ŋ tokɗuki a tum ŋ keeñiŋ Tit wuu ɗu. Tokɗukeem weɗ wi a tum ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>A teyɗukiɗ hay ɗiskiŋ ɗu findi ɓoo woyohee ɗe wa, wa raak ɗe sah sawriɗ nga keeh-keeh.<verse eid="2CO 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Ɓoo tuuƴndohiɗ na ɗe ɓaah ɓoo yi fu inah ne Janguuci jen na woye in moɗiɗ nga ɗe sagu pangkiŋ ɗe ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Te sah a yi Janguuci kooɗ ne a ɓend ɓoo ne ɓoo ɓayee ɓaatɗohi ɗah. Ɓoo heya tume yakɗoha Heɗi, wa nam teeɓoh waaɗi ɓoo waaɗa tum. <verse eid="2CO 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Ɓoo na tumohe ɗaa ne ali ɓo' raakuu woyaah ŋ findi ɓoo na taambkohe ɓaatɗohi laayiɗi nangɗohu. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/>Ɓoo na waaɗe tum in lakiɗ waas, ŋ fiki Heɗi dong haa, waaye na fiki ɓooɓi.<verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Ɓoo namiɗ tuuƴndoh ŋ ɓi na haye, ɓaah ɓoo yi fu inah ne ɓoo markiskiɗ ɗe waas laayiɗ ŋ findi a tokɗukoh, te waasii a uup nga sawar sagu oolki a ooluk ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ Tit, a mi na ɗe na pangke, e ɓoo ɓaah pangki wuu ɗu. Waaye ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo ɓinooɓi, e Janguuci tuuƴ ɓa, e yakiɗ Kiristaani tah ɓa kuruk. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Kon teeɓaat ɓa ne ɗu waaɗiɗ ɓa, ɗu tuma ɗah, ɓooɓiŋ Janguuci hey inhe ineem, wa teeɓoh ne wa waas, ɓoo ndamkohee ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ nangɗohiŋ onohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ ɓaatɗohi na nangɗohse wuu kosiɗ ci, wa etohɗi ŋ fiisissee ne ŋ woo ɗu in nga. <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>Ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu waaɗiɗ ɓa ɓaatɗoh lool, ŋ ndamkohiɗ ɗu ŋ fiki ɓi Maseduwaan, ŋ woo ɓa ne ɗu ɓi Akaay, ɗu ƴutiɗ ne ɗu eɗoh ɓaatɗoh yukma poyi. Te sawriŋ ɗu weem, yuniɗ ɓi laayiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Waaye ŋ woosiɗ ɓi Tit ne ndamkohi ŋ ndamkoh ɗu weem nikuu ŋ ɓarngi, te ɗu tum po wa nik findi ŋ woyoha.<verse eid="2CO 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Wa miniɗ nik ne raakiɗ ɓi Maseduwaan ɓi ɓendan ndo. Ɓoo sang ne ɓa raakuu ɗu ƴutiɗ ne ɗu eɗoh, mbaa oolki ŋ ooluk ɗu hey nike kaci nga ɓoo, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa ɗu. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Weɗ tah, ŋ hotta ne wa cariɗ ne ŋ tuuƴ ɓi Tit, ɓa adug ko, ɓa taambkoh ɓaatɗohi ɗu gapohee eɗoh. Ŋ ineem, wa hey ƴute bala ŋ hayan ɗah, wa nik ini ɗu onoh na keeñ soosiɗ.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>Inhaat ne : Ɓoyi na soke ƴissuut, na nguɗe ƴissuut te yi na soke laayiɗ, na nguɗe laayiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Kon yaa nu nga eɗohaat ini a kooɗkee eɗoh ŋ keeñiŋ ɗe, inwaaso ambuu ɗe nga, keeñiŋ ɗe soos nga ; Kooh waaɗ ɓoyi na eɗohe te a sum nga. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Te Kooh miniɗ ɗu on in baahiɗ nu nik, ɗu genan raak in nu ɗu etoh ɗah, ɗu raak po ca gaacaac, ɗu min tum in baahiɗ nu nik. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>Findi Fiis ci woyoha an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">« A na payse ñakiɗ ci laayiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">baah kiŋ ɗe gen gen. » <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Sabuur 112:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Kooh yi na eɗe sokohi tisoh, na kañam pesoha, a hey ɗu name eɗ tisoh, a ɓaata po baah kiŋ ɗu raak rim laayiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>Ŋ ineem, ɗu hey nike heɗ raak-raak ŋ in ci jen, ɗu min onoh keeh-keeh, ɓo' laayiɗ corkiɗ Kooh ŋ in ci ɗu eɗan ɓoo ne ɓoo eɗ ɓa ca. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>Laam eɗohiŋ ɓaatɗohii, wa topɗi rek ŋ ɓaatɗoh kosiɗ ci ŋ etoh ciŋ ɓa, waaye wa hey tahe po corkiɗi Kooh corkiɗassan uup nga laay.<verse eid="2CO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>Ini ɗu tuman weem, wa hey teeɓohe findi ɗu tokɗukoh, te ɓo' laayiɗ hey yakɗe Kooh ŋ teyɗuki ɗu teyɗuk taambiɗ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> kaɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. Ɓa hey ɗe name yakiɗ ŋ ini ɗu paysoh raak-raakiŋ ɗu na keeñ soosiɗ na ɓa na ɓooɓi jen. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>Ɓa hey ɗu kiimɗe Kooh, sagu waaɗi ɓa waaɗ ɗu laam ɓa hotiɗ baahohi yakki Kooh baahoh ɗu keeh-keeh.<verse eid="2CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Kooh corkiɗaah ŋ onohiŋ ɗe raakɗi hend !<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Pool langiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Ini kaɗ nga so mi yi Pool, ɓa na woye ne ŋ nikka ŋ fikiiɗu ɗah, mi na nike neek, ŋ ussa ɗah, ŋ kaañ. Waaye mi yii kiim ɗu inii ŋ tiikiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> yi eɗef te a baahha : <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Ŋ kiim ɗu ne, kinaat to tah hay nga ɗu na kaañ, wa wooriɗ to ne ŋ hey tume ineem, te ɓooɓi na liiɓe ne tumohaaɗiŋ ɓoo mand na wiŋ ɓi Adina hey hote.<verse eid="2CO 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Wa keeh ne ɓoo ɓii pes ŋ Adina, waaye ɓoo na hiñoheeɗi findi ɓi Adina na hiñohohe. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>Ganaay ci ɓoo na hiñohohe, ca pulohɗi Adina, ca puloh ŋ hatiliŋ Kooh, ca miniɗ yahroh taɓah naafkoha nu nik, liiɓ ci hunɗi na keeh, <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>na in nu na yakɗuke ne wa hondoh ɓooɓi inah Kooh ɗah, te ɓoo na dege liiɓ ci jen yaah ne ca kerhiɗ Kiristaani. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>Kaɗ po kerhiɗiŋ ɗu na ɗe mit ɗah, ɓoo ƴutiɗ ne ɓoo deg kerhiɗaaɗi nu nik ŋ waas.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>Markaat in ci baahiɗ ! Ɓo' nu wa woor ne a ɓaah ŋ Kiristaani ɗah, a inhaat ne ɓoo nam ɓaah ŋ Kiristaani findiice ! <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Wa miniɗ nik ne ŋ yaksiɗkiɗ ƴissuut ŋ kikilifaaki Heɗi tum nga ɓoo, waaye ŋ raakanɗi kaci nga, ɓoo eɗu wa ne ɓoo kaɗiɗ ɗu fiki, waaye ne ɓoo yahroh ɗu haa. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>Ŋ woyiɗ ineem laam ŋ waaɗɗi ne wa mand haa ne mi na tiitɗukee ɗu ŋ fiis ci mi na kaɓɗohee ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Raakiɗ ɓi na woye ne : « Fiis ci Pool na kaɓɗohe, a na woye woo ndengiɗ nga ca, woo ɓitiɗ, waaye a hayootta ɗah, a na mande na ɓoyi raakɗi hatil te a minɗi woo tus. » <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Ɓo' nu na woye ineem ɗah, a ambaat ne findi woo ciŋ ɓoo mand ŋ kayit ci, ɓoo hay ɗah, tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo mandan ɗaa.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>Ɓoo kaañɗi mandtiɗkoh wala hendtiɗkoh na ɓi ɓo' nga, ɓi na woye ne ɓeɗ haf ɓa, ɓeɗ min pangki. Waaye ɓa na hendtiɗkohe ŋ haf ɓa, ɓa kooɗee misaal ŋ haf ɓa, ineem, wa inhaaɗi. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Ini kaɗ nga ɓoo nak, ɓoo heyɗi yaksiɗke yaksiɗuk uupiɗ ; ɓoo na yaksiɗkohe pangki Kooh eɗ ɓoo ŋ ɗisik ci a tuuƴ ɓoo dong, po ɗiskiŋ ɗu sah. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>Ɓoo cootukɗi ɗiski a topiɗ ɓoo, ini ɓoo sasu hayiɗ po nga ɗu ; laam a ɓoo koc hay po nga ɗu na <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani.<verse eid="2CO 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Ɓoo heyɗi ndamkohe panguk ɓo' wiiriis, mbaa, ɓoo uupiɗ. Waaye ɓoo raakiɗ yaakaar ne kosiŋ ɗu ɓaatuk ɗah, ɓoo hey ɓaate angiɗ pangki ŋ harmban ɗu, te ɓoo cootkanɗi ɗiski ɓoo topɗu. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓoo hey mine kaɗ usiɗ woya Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ɗisik ci wa reeɗi, ɓoo aasuu ŋ ɗiski ɓo' wiiriis na pangke po ɓoo kee ndamkoha pangkiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="2CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>Fiis ci woyiɗ ne : « Ɓo' nu na yaksiɗke ɗah, a yaksiɗkohaat Heɗi ! »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Yeremi 9:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Laam ɓoyi na woye ŋ haf ce ne a yi min, a yi teyɗukaah haa, waaye a yi Heɗi woo ne a yi min !<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">Pool na <char style="tl">apootar</char> ci leyoh ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Ɗu mineen ndo muñiɗ ƴissuut ŋ woo ɗu woo naandoha ɗah ! Waaye ɗu ɓii muñiɗ to sah ! <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Ŋ waaɗ ɗu waaɗ po maa fiire'ee ɗu fiire miskiɗ, fiireeni puloh ŋ Kooh. Ŋ teyɗukiɗ ɗu ƴaar yino kut, yi nguɗ <char style="w">cakiim</char> nga ɗu ; te ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗu ɗe eɗ, a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>, findi cafaƴ inhaaɗi ƴaar yi hool fec na wikohse. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/>Waaye, findi iiña ñaañohohee Aawa ŋ tumohaaɗ caŋ ɗe,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Camba 3:1-6</ref></char></note> ŋ neƴƴohiɗ ne liiɓ ciŋ ɗu nduuɗu po ɗu faɗɗukohu ambi ɗu amb ndengiɗ ŋ Kiristaani te wa hunnda na hool.<verse eid="2CO 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Ɓo' hay nga ɗu, teeɓee ɗu Yeesu, teeɓ ɗalohiɗ na findi ɓoo woyoh ɗu ɗah, ɗu hey ɗe teyɗuke. Wala ɓo' hay, gap ɗu fuuɗis wiiriis ɗalohiɗ na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ɗu rahas, wala a yegɗohee yegɗoh wiiriis ɗalohiɗ na <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> ɗu teyɗuk ɗah, ɗu hey teyɗuke ɓoyeem baahiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Ŋ ambiɗ ne <char style="w"><char style="tl">apootar</char></char> ciŋ ɗu yakak ci ɗu na woye ɓeem, ɓa uupiɗɗi so ali in. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Ali nik ne ŋ minɗi woo, ŋ nikɗi inhaaɗi in ciŋ Kooh ; te ɓoo teeɓohiɗa hooliɗ ŋ in ci jen.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Ŋ ruhsiɗ ruhsiɗ haf fo, ŋ meeɓpa ɗu, ŋ wirndiɗukɗi ɗu wi ŋ woyee ɗu Yegɗohiŋ Muci, wi puloh ŋ Kooh. Ini ŋ tum weem bakaaɗ e ? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Ŋ ɓay kopor ŋ ɓi Jangu wiiriis, ɓi teyɗuk ko ɓaatɗoh, ne ŋ panguk wuu ɗu. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/>Te wi ŋ nik ŋ ɗiskiŋ ɗu, ŋ ñakka in ɗah, mi na hayeeɗi ŋ ali ɓo' ŋ yaaɓɗee ɗe. Wa kaɗohee ɗaa po findi ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo pulohee Maseduwaan hayoh, ɓeɗ eɗ to ini ŋ etohe. Ŋ moosɗi yaaɓɗoh ali ɓo' nga ɗu, te wa moosanɗi nik. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Findi wa wooroh ne keeh ki puloh ŋ Kiristaani weɗi nga so, wa wooroh ɗaa ne ali ɓo' ŋ kur ciŋ Akaay minɗi so hondoh ndamuk ŋ ineem ! <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>Wa ye tah ŋ woosa ineem ? Ŋ waaɗɗi ɗu waaɗɗi e ? Kooh inhiɗ ne ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗu ! <verse eid="2CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>Findi mi na tumohe, ŋ faɗanɗaa, laam raakiɗ ɓi na waake naafkoha, waaye ŋ onanɗi ɓa wa, po ɓa kee hendtiɗkoha na ɓoo ŋ yaksiɗki ɓa na yaksiɗke.<verse eid="2CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Ɓooɓeem, ɓa <char style="tl">apootar</char> leyoh, ɓa pangkoh ci na ñaañohohe, ɓa na kulɓa'kohe ne ɓa <char style="tl">apootar</char> ciŋ Kiristaani. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Wa nikɗi in feyohiɗ. Seytaani sah na kulɓa'kohe kulɓa'koh malaaka leer. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Kon wa feyohɗi ne pangkoh ciŋ ɗe namee kulɓa'koh pangkoh yurhiɗ. Waaye ŋ reehɗohaaniŋ ɓa, ɓa hey wirndasse baahaaɗiikiŋ panguk ciŋ ɓa jen.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miskiɗ ci <char style="tl">Apootar</char> Pool coh na ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>Ŋ woyisa, ali ɓo' kinaat to amboh findi naandiɗ - wala teyɗukaat naandohaaciŋ ngo, po ŋ nam min tipuk ƴissuut ! <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Ini mi na hee woye wii, ŋ wooɗi wa findi Heɗi na woyohe, wa ɓaah ŋ naandohaaciŋ ngo, wa tipuk rek. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Laam raakiɗ laayiɗ ɓi na tipke ŋ in ciŋ Adina, mi na hee name tipuk findiiɓa. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>Ɗu ɓi ñaañiɗ ci, ŋ hotiɗ ne ɗu teyɗukiɗ te ɗu neɓuuɗ ŋ ɓooɓi naandiɗ ci ! <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Ɗu teyɗukiɗ ne ɓa ñaamɗukohee ɗu, ɓa ɓayee in ciŋ ɗu jen, ɓa njirñiɗkohee ɗu, ɓa yaksiɗkee ŋ ɗafuk ɗu, ɓa tipee ɗu paɗ ! <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>A', mi deey, ŋ meeɗɗi tumoh ɗaa. Ŋ supkiɗa woo, waaye wa keeh ne ɓoo tasiɗ kaañ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Moona in nu ɓo' kaañ ɗah, ŋ kaañiɗa - ee, mi na woye naandohaaciŋ ngo nak ! <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Ɓa na woye ne ɓa Heber e ? Ŋ nam nik Heber. Ɓa ɓaah ŋ Israayel e ? Ŋ nam ɓaah ŋ Israayel. Ɓa set ciŋ Ibrahiima e ? Ŋ nam nik setiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/>Ɓa pangkoh ciŋ Kiristaani e ? - Faɗa ŋ woo naandoha - ñam uup ɓa wa nik. Nik panguk miskiɗ ɗah, ñam uupiɗ ɓa nga ; nik taƴ ŋ kaso ɗah, ñam uupiɗ ɓa nga ; nik laɓu ɗah, e laɓ ci ŋ laɓu uup laay fuuf ! Waas laayiɗ, ŋ hotee ŋ kakaan ki an.<verse eid="2CO 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Ini ree waas yatuus, Yawuut ci laɓiɗ to leraw ciŋ ɓa ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na yasna-nikiis (39)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">Waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> sangohiɗ ne ɓo' laɓu ini uup waas ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40). Yawuut ci sangee ɗal ineem, weɗ tah ɓa meeɗeen laɓ ɓo' leraw po ɓa ree waas ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay na yasna-nikiis, ɓa tufkiɗ. Marka teerndiŋ </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 2:1-3">Rohƴiɗi 2:1-3</ref></char>.</note> ciŋ ɓa, <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/>ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> laɓiɗ to na ndooɗ ciŋ ɓa waas kaahay, ŋ moosiɗ tapsohu atoh ne ŋ apu, waas kaahay <char style="tl">bato</char> diigiɗ na so ŋ cookmi, ŋ tumiɗ noh yino na wek yino ŋ ɗooƴ masmiŋ cookmi. <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/>Ŋ ɓaaɓ ciŋ ngo laayiɗ ci, ŋ cohiɗ na in wooraaɗi laayiɗ : nupɗiŋ kal ci, na nguɗndukohoh ci, cum ɗah ɓaah ciŋ ngo Yawuut ci waaɗ to tum miskiɗ, wala ɓi nikɗi Yawuut sah, cum ɗah ŋ coh na in wooraaɗi ŋ kur ci, na nduufi, na cookmi, cum ɗah sah e ɓi na woye ne ɓa ɓaah na ɗa kos na ɓekee ɗa wa. <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Cum ɗah ŋ pangkee ɗiska panguk uup miskoh ; ŋ raak neeh laayiɗ neehaaɗi, cum ɗah ŋ aɗuk, cum ɗah ŋ sifaɗuk, waas laayiɗ ŋ raak mbeh mulnguus ñamaaɗi ; soosi hee so ape, cum ɗah ŋ ñak ɓekkaah.<verse eid="2CO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>Laayiɗ tasiɗ, waaye ca tahɗi so woo, ɗal wi na range hafiŋ ngo Kooh-nu-wiis, liiɓsiɗohi ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Janguuci jen ! <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Ŋ hotta ɓoyi ndengɗi ŋ kosiŋ ɗe ɗah, wa goyiɗ to. Ɓo' bakaaɗɗukoh morom ce ɗah, wa aay yo keeñ ! <verse eid="2CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>Nik ne ŋ joy joy tipuk ɗah, ŋ tipkohan raakaaɗiikiŋ ngo hatil. <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Kooh, yi nik Koohiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi, a nammba nik Baabiŋ ɗe te a ƴeekaah po faw, a inhiɗ ne ŋ leyɗi. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Wa ŋ nik ŋ Damas, goornoora nikiɗee buur Aretaas nga nakoheen niiɗu buntaacaŋ miira wil kur-taaha jen ne a amb mbo, <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/>waaye ŋ ɓeku ŋ pañe, ŋ taambɗuusa ŋ palaŋteeraŋ miira, ŋ yooruusa huntiɗkohiɗ naa, ŋ fussa ɗe.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">In ci hayɗoh Pool haa heeƴ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Nik ndii tipkee raakɗi njiriñ, waaye ŋ joyiɗa tum. Ŋ hey woye in ci hayɗoh ho haa heeƴ na ci ɗasɗukiɗ ci Heɗi teeɓ po. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Ŋ inhiɗ ɓo' nikiɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. Wa tumiɗ kiis ndaŋkiyaah na nikiis (14) kotii, wi Kooh ɓay ƴaareem po ŋ Asamaana kaahayɗoh. Andi a ɓay ɗe na faaniŋ ɗe ? Ŋ inahɗi. Andi na faaniŋ ɗe haa ? Ŋ inahɗi, waaye Kooh inhiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3,4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3,4"/>Ee, ŋ inhiɗ ne ƴaareem ɓayuuɗ po ŋ Aljana (Ŋ woyis ne, ŋ inahɗi andi wa nikee na faaniŋ ɗe wala. Kooh dong a yi inah), te ndaam, a kerhiɗ woo ci minɗi woyu te ali ɓo' onuuɗi ne a woo ca.<verse eid="2CO 12:3,4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Ŋ hey ndamke ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ƴaareem - waaye, ini kaɗ nga so, ŋ ndamkanɗi ɗal ŋ ñaki ŋ ñak hatil. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Te kat, ŋ waakeen hotaat to ɗah, ŋ heeɗi nike naandiɗ, ŋ hee woye ini raak. Waaye mi na wortuke wortuk waak hotaat to, laam ŋ waaɗɗi ne ɓooɓi liiɓ nga so ini uup ini ɓa na hotee so haɓɗe, wala wi ɓa na kerhee so woye.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Waaye, ne ŋ yaksiɗkuu ŋ haf fo ŋ in ci feyohiɗ ci ŋ teeɓu, faaniŋ ngo ɓeku rup ; rupeem, weɗ ini Seytaani woos ne wa laɓ po, Kooh sang ne ŋ hotsiɗuk. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Waas kaahay ŋ kiimiɗa Heɗi ne a saɓsoh ho na ineem. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>A loffa so ne : « Baahohi ŋ baahoh ɗa doyiɗ. Hatiliŋ ngo na hotke hooliɗ ne fu ñak hatil ɗah. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 12:9">Kon ini uup po neɓ, weɗ ne ŋ waak hotaat to ŋ ñaki ŋ ñak hatil, ineem weɗ na hee tahe hatiliŋ Kiristaani nik nga so. <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Ineem weɗ tah ho neɓu ngaŋ nik ndengaaɗi, ŋ neɓuusa ŋ ɓas ci, na miskiɗ ci, na tolfiɗ ci, na neƴƴoh ci, sagu Kiristaani ; laam, ŋ ñakka hatil ɗah, weɗ mi na raakohe hatil.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pool waaɗ ne ɓi Korenta kaɗ fiki ŋ kosiŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Ŋ naandtiɗohiɗ, waaye e ɗu ɓek ko nga, ɗu ɓi joyee so meeɓ. Ali nik ne ŋ tus haa, <char style="w"><char style="tl">apootar</char></char> ciŋ ɗu yakak ci uupɗi so ŋ ali in. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>In ci teeɓoh ne ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char>, ca tumuuɗ ŋ harmban ɗu. Ca tumuuɗ na min muñ keeh-keeh na firnde na keemaan na in feyohiɗ nu nik. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>Janguuci cinooci tumɗu ye ɗu tumɗuuɗi wa ? Ɗal degi ŋ degɗi ɗu ali in, mi ŋ haf fo. Ɗaasaat to wa !<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Ŋ ƴutiɗ ne ŋ hay ɗiskiŋ ɗu waasi kaahayɗoh, te ŋ deganɗi ɗu ali in. Mi na waakee ɗu, waaye koporiŋ ɗu haa. Kuɓuuci na nangɗoheeɗi kopor wuu ɓi rim ɓa, e ɓi rim ɓa na nangɗohɗee ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Ini kaɗ nga so, ŋ teyɗukiɗ na keeñ soosiɗ ne ŋ eɗoh ini ŋ raak jen, te sah ŋ eɗoh haf fo jen wuu ɗu. Waaɗi ŋ waaɗ ɗu, findi wa yakoh, hanaa, waaɗi ɗu waaɗ to uupanɗi nga haawsuk ?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Ɗu teyɗukiɗ ne ŋ raanɗi ɗu ali in. Waaye ɓum amb ne ŋ lahiɗ ŋ ɗisik wiiriis ŋ ñaañohha ɗu. <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>Ɓooɓi ŋ woosee nga ɗu, ŋ njirñiɗkohiɗ ɗu taamboh ŋ yino nga ɓa e ? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Ŋ kiimeen Tit ne a hay nga ɗu, ŋ ambsohha ɗe na ɓaah ɓoo yi hunee na ɗe. Tit njirñiɗkoh ɗu njirñiɗkoh e ? Ŋ hot a njirñiɗkohɗi ɗu ! Andi mi na ɗe ɓoo ɓaahɗi ɓaahɗi liiɓohaaɗ wala ini ɓoo na tiinde ?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>Ɗu liiɓ ne ina mi na woye poyi, mi na waaɗe hooliɗ haf ɓoo ŋ fikiiɗu e ? A'aa ! Ɓoo na woye ŋ fiki Kooh na niki ɓoo nik ŋ Kiristaani, te in ci ɓoo na woyee ɗu jen, ɓoo na woyee ɗu ca, ne ɗu kaɗ fiki ŋ kosi ɗu kos, ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh.<verse eid="2CO 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Laam ŋ neƴƴohiɗ ne ŋ ree ɗiskiŋ ɗu ɗah, ŋ raakanɗi ɗu findi ŋ waaɗoh, te ɗu namanɗi so hotoh findi ɗu waaɗoh. Ŋ neƴƴohiɗ ne ŋ raak ŋ harmban ɗu lahtoh na siisoh, ayrukoh, nookoh, ɓasoh, ɗooɓoh, hotsiɗuk na ɗuuɗ. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Ŋ neƴƴohiɗ ne ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ngo na haye, Koohiŋ ngo ƴissuutɗis so ŋ fikiiɗu, te ɓo' laayiɗ fuɗɗukoh ho, ɓi ris bakaaɗ findi ɗeɓgaan te ɓa eɗɗi usuɓ finho, na faankoh sangohuuɗ na cakaay.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ñaahoh ciŋ Pool mirndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>Wii weɗ waasi kaahayɗoh ne ŋ hey ɗu marke. Findi Fiis ci woyoha : « Seede kanak wala kaahay raak ɗah, in nu nik miniɗ tufkiɗu. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Rohƴiɗi 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Wi ŋ hay kotiŋ ngo kanakɗoh, ŋ woyeena, te woti ŋ nikɗi nga, waaye mi yii woyisa ɓi bakaaɗee waam, na ɓinooɓi jen : Ŋ hayis ɗu marke ɗah, ŋ faɗanɗi ali ɓo' ! <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>Ɗu na waake firndeeni <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> na woyohe taamboh nga so haa e ? Nga ɗu, a ñakɗi hatil, a na tume na hatil ŋ harmban ɗu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>A daaƴu ŋ kurwaana ŋ ñak hatil, waaye a yii pes ŋ hatiliŋ Kooh. Ɓoo namiɗ ñak hatil ŋ niki ɓoo nik nga ɗe, waaye ɗu hey hote ne ɓoo ɓii pes na ɗe taamboh ŋ hatiliŋ Kooh.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>Ɓeesaat haf ɗu baahiɗ po ɗu inah andi ɗu ɓii ŋ kosi ; waakaat firndeeni ŋ haf ɗu. Wa wooriɗ ɗu ne Yeesu Kiristaa yii nga ɗu e ? Wa ɗaleen ineem ɗah, ɓeesi ɗu ɓees haf ɗu heen teeɓohe ne ɗu jallaaɗi. <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Waaye ŋ oolkiɗ ne ɗu hey hote firndeeni ne ɓoo nikɗi jalla'aaɗi. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Ɓoo na kiime Kooh ne ɗu tumuu ali in baahaaɗi ; wa nikɗi haa ne ɓoo na waaɗe teeɓoh ne ɓoo <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> baahiɗ. Waaye ɓoo na kiime Kooh ne ɗu tumee ini baah. Ini uup po neɓ weɗ ne ŋ etohɗi ɓees hatiliŋ ki'apootar kiŋ ngo.<verse eid="2CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Laam ɓoo raakɗi hatil hiñohoha keeh ki ; hatiliŋ ɓoo, wa hiñohoha wuu keeh ki dong. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Ɓoo ñak hatil te ɗu raak hatil ɗah, ɓoo hey neɓse nga, waaye ini ɓoo na kiime Kooh weɗ ne ɗu nik ɓo' mitiɗ. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Weɗ tah po ŋ kaɓɗohee ɗu fiisii ŋ nikaaɗiikiŋ ngo nga ; ne kaɗ po ŋ nik nga ɗah, wa etohuu ne ŋ tum nga ɗu tumohaaɗ ndengiɗ ŋ kikilifaaki Heɗi eɗ to. A eɗ to wa yahrohoha kosiŋ ɗu haa, waaye kaɗɗohaa wa fiki.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Ini mirndoh, ɓaah ciŋ ngo, sumaat, haɓɗissaat pesohaaɗiŋ ɗu, ñaahtiɗohaat, kerhiɗohaat, pesaat ŋ jam, te Kooh yi riif na waaɗoh na jam hey nike na ɗu. <verse eid="2CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>Kañɗohaat ŋ harmban ɗu, ɗu morgiɗkohee, wa hun na keeñ hooliɗ. <char style="w" lemma="ɓo'-Kooh ci">Ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> nik ndii jen ɓa ɗii kañiɗ ɗu.<verse eid="2CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Baahohiŋ Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi na waaɗi Kooh waaɗ ɗu na ambsukohi ɓoo raak ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> nikaat na ɗu jen !<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
